title Eventory REST API — UML API Diagram (Sparx-style UML Profile)

class "EventoryAPI" as EventoryAPI <<Application>> {
  {field} { basePath = "/api/v1" }
}

note bottom of EventoryAPI
  Each microservice also exposes
  GET /health (: 204 | 500 | 503)
  outside { basePath = "/api/v1" }.
  Protected operations require
  Authorization: Bearer <JWT>.
end note

